{"sha":"7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","node_id":"C_kwDOAgOC1doAKDdhMWZmY2RmMzhjYzc2ZDFjNGVhZTUxNjUxNjY3ZjNmZDQ1NDhhYjA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Milan Kyselica","email":"mil.kyselica@gmail.com","date":"2026-03-24T18:22:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"George Joseph","email":"gtjoseph@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-25T14:21:09Z"},"message":"res_pjsip_pubsub: Add width limit to sscanf in MWI NOTIFY parser\n\nThe parse_simple_message_summary() function uses sscanf with an\nunbounded %s format specifier to parse the Message-Account field\nfrom incoming SIP NOTIFY bodies into a fixed-size 512-byte stack\nbuffer (PJSIP_MAX_URL_SIZE). A single unauthenticated SIP NOTIFY\nwith a Message-Account value exceeding 512 bytes overflows the\nbuffer, corrupting adjacent stack data and permanently disabling\nthe PJSIP transport layer without crashing the process.\n\nAdd a width specifier (%511s) to limit the sscanf write to\nPJSIP_MAX_URL_SIZE - 1 bytes plus the NUL terminator, matching\nthe destination buffer size.\n\nResolves: #GHSA-589g-qgf8-m6mx","tree":{"sha":"fa5b2de8a9805b8cda3dde0cb811fcba2ac37584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/git/trees/fa5b2de8a9805b8cda3dde0cb811fcba2ac37584"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/git/commits/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","html_url":"https://github.com/asterisk/asterisk/commit/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asterisk/asterisk/commits/7a1ffcdf38cc76d1c4eae51651667f3fd4548ab0/comments","author":{"login":"mil1200","id":18125445,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTI1NDQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18125445?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mil1200","html